('111-4301-058','111-4301',58,'single_choice',2,'When the director and the corporation are both parties to a transaction which involves a director''s conflicting interests. The director cannot participate in the corporate decision-making process that approves the transaction in order to avoid violating the to the corporation.','duty of care','duty of loyalty','duty of reliance','duty of good deed',null,'法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],11,11,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
('111-4301-059','111-4301',59,'single_choice',2,'If a Supreme Court Justice agrees with the outcome of the case, but not the majority’s rationale for it, that Justice may write a opinion.','dissenting','majority','plurality','concurring',null,'法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],11,11,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
('111-4301-060','111-4301',60,'single_choice',2,'Mary tried to collect on an airline trip insurance policy she had purchased, but was refused by the insurance company on the ground that the policy applied only to a trip on “scheduled airline” and that “technically” under some obscure regulations Mary’s flight was not “scheduled,” even though she had every reason to believe that it was. The court held in favor of Mary on the ground that ordinary insurance buyer’s understanding should apply, since this was a contract .','of beneficence','of adhesion','for deed','under seal',null,'法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],11,11,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
('111-4301-061','111-4301',61,'single_choice',2,'Sean submitted and Rene accepted a bid to supply approximately 4,000 tons of trap rock for an airport at a unit price. The parties executed a standard form of “Invitation, Bid, and Acceptance (Short From Contract)” supplied by Rene, including typed terms “to be delivered to project as required,” “delivery to start immediately,” and “cancellation by Rene may be effected at any time.” However, requires that Rene orders and accepts the rock within a reasonable time unless Rene has given Sean a notice of intent to cancel.','good faith','good feeling','good intent','good will',null,'法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],11,11,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
('111-4301-062','111-4301',62,'single_choice',2,'Securities law intervenes in corporate governance in several ways. From the example of Taiwan’s securities law, which of the following does not reflect this intervention?','Companies cannot solicit and receive proxy from shareholders freely.','Companies need to make a public financial disclosure every season or year.','A certain number of independent directors are required for newly listed companies.','When issuing new stock, participating underwriters need to have licenses, meet strict qualifications, and cannot be bypassed.',null,'法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],11,11,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
